        'n2m.ex6': '[Info] Tag {tag} EX 6 current source ({mag}A∠{phase}°) mapped numerically to an MMANA voltage source ({mag}V∠{phase}°) — MMANA only supports voltage sources; feed-point impedance/current semantics differ, please verify.',
