        'n2m.badLoadRow': '🚨 The following Load rows have invalid format and were removed from the output (see Warnings at the end of the file):\n\n{rows}\n\nValid format: w<wire><c/b/e>[±offset], type 0/1, numbers… (at least 4 fields)',
